  "step_2": "The individual states: 'Ich nehme A da der Betrag 100€ mehr war. 0,1% unterschiede bei der Wahrscheinlichkeit sind für mich weiterhin nicht gross von Bedeutung.' This translates to: 'I choose A because the amount was 100€ more. 0.1% differences in probability are still not significant to me.' The individual explicitly focuses on the higher monetary amount in Lottery A (2500 vs. 2400) and dismisses the small difference in probabilities (33% vs. 34%) as negligible. The justification centers on the outcome value being higher in A, while downplaying probabilistic differences.",
